<title>UK: SEK sets $75 million December 1999 bond.</title>
<headline>SEK sets $75 million December 1999 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH EXPORT CREDIT (SEK)</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    28.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE  L-28.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    100.3125  SPREAD	+7 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA+	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA3	 DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND U.S. TREASURY DUE AUGUST 1999</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
